                    <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
                        Identifies the sealed AES-256-GCM ciphertext blob and checks expiration time or view limits. If "Burn After Reading" is enabled, the server deletes the ciphertext immediately upon delivery.
                    </p>
